{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Lair of the Locksmith",
    "steam_appid": 2607430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607430/extras/134d17e96cfdaa13e8929730f074aa34.webp?t=1746944953\" width=170 height=43 /></span><br><strong>Lair of the Locksmith</strong> is a puzzle game about keys, experimentation and logic.<br> <br>Your goal is to rescue imprisoned goblins from a dwarvish citadel full of locked doors. The focus is squarely on puzzle-solving, rather than precision-platforming. You combine keys to create new keys which can unlock doors and open up more rooms. <br><br>Which door should you unlock next? Which keys should you use? Can you get this key to that door without touching other keys? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607430/extras/93870f66242a2f86608567274f56b73e.webp?t=1746944953\" width=154 height=43 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A multitude of handcrafted single-screen levels each with a unique challenge.<br></li><li> Made a mistake? Hold down <i>Rewind</i> to smoothly reverse time.<br></li><li> Level seems impossible? Experiment and discover a new tactic. <br></li><li> Totally stuck? There are often other unlocked levels to try.<br></li><li> Boxes: you can jump on them, carry them, put keys on them or stack them.<br></li><li> Cursed keys: they leap into your hands and don't want to be dropped.<br></li><li> Heavy keys: you can't jump with them, be careful if you drop one!<br></li><li> Chickens!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607430/extras/134d17e96cfdaa13e8929730f074aa34.webp?t=1746944953\" width=170 height=43 /></span><br><strong>Lair of the Locksmith</strong> is a puzzle game about keys, experimentation and logic.<br> <br>Your goal is to rescue imprisoned goblins from a dwarvish citadel full of locked doors. The focus is squarely on puzzle-solving, rather than precision-platforming. You combine keys to create new keys which can unlock doors and open up more rooms. <br><br>Which door should you unlock next? Which keys should you use? Can you get this key to that door without touching other keys? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607430/extras/93870f66242a2f86608567274f56b73e.webp?t=1746944953\" width=154 height=43 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A multitude of handcrafted single-screen levels each with a unique challenge.<br></li><li> Made a mistake? Hold down <i>Rewind</i> to smoothly reverse time.<br></li><li> Level seems impossible? Experiment and discover a new tactic. <br></li><li> Totally stuck? There are often other unlocked levels to try.<br></li><li> Boxes: you can jump on them, carry them, put keys on them or stack them.<br></li><li> Cursed keys: they leap into your hands and don't want to be dropped.<br></li><li> Heavy keys: you can't jump with them, be careful if you drop one!<br></li><li> Chickens!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A subtle and challenging logic puzzle platformer. Combine magic keys to unlock doors, find more keys, unlock more doors and rescue your fellow goblins from the lair of a devious dwarvish locksmith.",
